# diff-wasm artifacts: GENERATED AST packs (via scripts/build-ast-packs.ts,
# rebuild with `npm run diff:build-wasm`) and cargo build trees. The text
# crate (text-build/) is NOT a scratch tree — it is the text-wasm's recipe
# and has no generator: it is TRACKED, so a fresh clone can rebuild.
# (Vestigial entries for the old packages/tooling/diff-wasm/* location and
# the deleted ast-build/ fork-copy are gone with them.)
/packages/framework/diff-wasm/ast/
/packages/framework/diff-wasm/target/
/packages/framework/diff-wasm/text-build/target/
/packages/framework/diff-wasm/src/natalia_diff_wasm.wasm
/packages/framework/object-store/native-index/target/
/packages/framework/object-store/native/target/
# The native-terminal package's PREBUILT drop directory: the one place a
# downloaded/unpacked Natalia (or a developer) drops the three terminal
# executables into (prebuilt/<triple>/). It holds multi-hundred-MB binaries,
# so it is never version-controlled — the resolver finds whatever a drop
# left there, and the archive/release stages its own copy.
/packages/plugins/native-terminal/prebuilt/
/packages/hosts/confinement/native/target/

